{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model with multiprofile setting and scvi_n200 encoder, achieving validation accuracy of 0.6501 and F1 of 0.6275. The result suggests multiprofile may improve performance compared to RNA-only singleprofile (config_003), but the role of the scvi_n200 encoder versus pca_n2000 remains uncertain. Uncertainty persists about whether multiprofile alone or multimodal integration (e.g., config_007) drives performance gains, as no direct comparison to multimodal variants was conducted."
}

